  npcName: Priest
  npcPortrait: {fileID: 3262813141468217335, guid: 00434a4d31b100243bccdbc8b6d41615,
    type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - 'The path ahead is unforgiving. Should your vitality fade completely, your spirit
    will shatter. But Fortuna offers a <color=orange>second chance</color> through
    a sacred summon. '
  - 'Bake a <color=orange>Vasilopita</color> at the tavern: <color=orange>two apples</color>
    and <color=orange>three peaches</color>, offered to the flames. Consume it, and
    it will summon a protective ward.'
  - 'Should you fall, the ward will catch your spirit and pull you back to the <color=orange>first
    statue</color>. '
  - Gather the fruit through her statues, bake it, and keep it close.
  - May Fortuna bless you.
  - May fortune favor your summons, child.
  typingSpeed: 0.05
